OL,3,GNEWSAChild hit by car near secondary
OL,4,Aschool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child has been injured after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car near a secondary school in
OL,8,FPeterborough.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police were called
OL,11,Fshortly before 15:30 BST to Goldhay
OL,12,FWay, near Ormiston Bushfield Academy.
OL,14,FOfficers remained at the scene and the
OL,15,Froad was partially blocked.
OL,17,FKirsty Knight, Conservative councillor
OL,18,Ffor Orton Waterville, said it was
OL,19,F"extremely worrying... speeding along
OL,20,FGoldhay Way had become a concern for
OL,21,Fresidents".
